{"unit_id":"huashenglian__dsh-livechat#card-zh","repo":"huashenglian/dsh-livechat","commit":"2fc73b33cd0cb709444fd8e49c935bfdbc9717e7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-livechat 是一款为 DSH Web 对话区添加 B 站风格弹幕的插件，也支持 DSH 桌面端。它通过 shell.overlay 挂载覆盖层，并由 Host 监听会话事件、提供配置与弹幕接口。主要功能包括预设弹幕和可选 LLM 吐槽、滚动与固定布局、拖动控制球、分会话弹幕池与历史回放，以及表情和礼物特效管理。适合希望在 agent 工作时获得直播式互动反馈的 DSH 用户。无需额外账号或 API Key；LLM 功能使用 DSH 已配置的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2290","lib/index.js:2445","lib/client.js:12955","lib/presets.js:3"]}
{"unit_id":"huashenglian__dsh-livechat#card-en","repo":"huashenglian/dsh-livechat","commit":"2fc73b33cd0cb709444fd8e49c935bfdbc9717e7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-livechat adds a Bilibili-style danmaku overlay to DSH Web and desktop. It reacts to session events and offers preset or optional LLM comments, adjustable layouts, a floating control ball, session history, emoji and gift effects. It uses DSH's configured model.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2290","lib/index.js:2445","lib/client.js:12955","lib/presets.js:3"]}
